                                                "sense_id": "f34d5050-63fc-358b-a0f8-eb6d180fd2da",
                                                "text": "But for a vast majority of cancers, more intensive regimens of standard chemotherapeutic drugs did not necessarily mean more survival."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "chemotherapeutic",
