                                                "sense_id": "4f2bc8ba-1009-348b-a3a7-c6a0ec0c01bf",
                                                "text": "Several novel chemotherapeutics that target specific signaling pathways are now available as anti-cancer agents including EGFR inhibitors and rapamycin."
